  Visione Telaio was born as a shared idea between Francesco and me,\
with the goal of creating a digital archive of his bicycle collection.\
 In this initial phase, I focused on creative direction, developing a\
        coherent and innovative visual identity for the project.\
    Over time, our team expanded and, following the first exhibition\
  at Sota, we felt the need to evolve Visione Telaio beyond a simple\
 archive. It gradually transformed into a true cycling club, dedicated\
  to building a strong and engaged community. This shift culminated in\
  the official launch through a social ride sponsored by Uniqlo, which\
provided jackets and jerseys that were later customized and distributed\
                           to the community.\
  Today, Visione Telaio has become a collaborative space where cycling\
 enthusiasts find inspiration and a sense of belonging within an active\
                         and engaged community.\
